  "rationale": "Target direct guest-call and host-callback kernels at small and large iteration counts, with n17 held out. P064 measures the bounded numeric prefix admitted in call-containing bodies: execution reaches the first control/call/reference/effect barrier and continues through the original decoded path. It does not introduce mid-loop OSR; unsupported whole-function and memory-only bodies continue to fall back. The timed target benefit may therefore be limited to work before the first barrier and is assessed independently from semantic eligibility. Preserve multi-value behavior, the tiny call cold controls, and large-module preparation.",
